{"t":"Spider Silk","s":"spider-silk-77aa5","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Spider_Silk_c6e732.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Spider Silk</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Spider Silk\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Silk_c6e732.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.10 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4,000 - 13,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170915201027&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Silk_c6e732.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  spider silk.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.10 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A semi-rare item. Because of its heavy use in obtaining addons as well as its low drop rate, spider silks have a good market value. However, this is declining with the introduction of many new areas with <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spiders</a>. Low levels can and often do complete the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantula</a> task of <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a> to get a high chance of looting one from the boss, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hide\">Hide</a>. Due to a (now fixed) game bug that allowed people to kill an unlimited number of task bosses using field runes, spider silks were heavily inflated even on Aurora and Aurera where World Transfer is forbidden.<br/>It looks the same as Recharging Tarantula Trap and <a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Spider%20Silk\">Steel Spider Silk</a>, which is also often used to scamming people through trade.\n</p><p>It is hard to see Spider Silk on light backgrounds due to it being white and stringy. Inside a container, it looks like this:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spider Silk (background)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Silk_background_9273c9.png\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p><p>100 of these (10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spool%20of%20Yarn\">Spool of Yarn</a>) are needed for <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-outfits-quest\">Barbarian Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n100 of these (10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spool%20of%20Yarn\">Spool of Yarn</a>) are needed for <a href=\"#/quest/assassin-outfits-quest\">Assassin Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n100 of these (10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spool%20of%20Yarn\">Spool of Yarn</a>) are needed for male <a href=\"#/quest/summoner-outfits-quest\">Summoner Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n100 of these (10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Spool%20of%20Yarn\">Spool of Yarn</a>) are needed for female <a href=\"#/quest/mage-outfits-quest\">Mage Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n1 is needed for <a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">What a foolish Quest</a>.<br/>\n10 of these can be traded for a <a href=\"#/wiki/Spool%20of%20Yarn\">Spool of Yarn</a> with <a href=\"#/wiki/Marina\">Marina</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>With update 8.5 this item was renamed from <b>Giant Spider Silk</b> to Spider Silk. This is because (in an earlier update?) other monsters such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spider</a> began dropping them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arachnophobica\">Arachnophobica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Spider\">Cave Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Cave%20Spider\">Exotic Cave Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hide\">Hide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mamma%20Longlegs\">Mamma Longlegs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Bloodweb\">The Bloodweb</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Old%20Widow\">The Old Widow</a></